OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic told patient to stop
OL,4,Aacting 'like a baby'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA paramedic has been struck off for
OL,7,Ftelling a woman suffering a stroke to
OL,8,Fstop acting "like a baby" and accused
OL,9,Fof them of lying about their pain.
OL,11,FThe Healthcare Professionals Tribunal
OL,12,FService heard Rachel Claire Lemonofides
OL,13,Fmade "inappropriate and degrading"
OL,14,Fcomments heard on a 999 call at the
OL,15,Fwoman's home in 2024.
OL,17,FIt found Lemonofides was guilty of
OL,18,Fracially motivated discrimination on
OL,19,Fthe grounds of ethnicity and breached
OL,20,Fprofessional boundaries.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
