OL,3,GNEWSAParamedic told patient to stop
OL,4,Aacting 'like a baby'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe patient underwent emergency surgery
OL,7,Fat Wythenshawe Hospital, Manchester,
OL,8,Fand was diagnosed with a brain bleed
OL,9,Fand abdominal aortic aneurysm. North
OL,10,FWest Ambulance Service said all
OL,11,Fpatients were "entitled to be treated
OL,12,Fwith dignity and respect".
